                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "gun god is a really good free boomer shooter there is no story but thats fine its free and fits the genre the graphics are very simple but i like them they are well done and expressive. the guns feel good to use but the minigun has an absurd amount of screenshake  but you can turn it off i didnt find this out until the final boss though overall i dont think it is as good as darkenstein 3d or the shrine series but aside from those it is probably the best free retro shooter i would give it an 8/10 i probably wont play it again but it was fun and the devs easily could of charged a few  dollars if they wanted to so shoutout to there generosity",
